    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15736" root="رضخ" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضِيخٌ</span></b>  [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوًى رَضِيخٌ</span>] and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْضُوخٌ</span></b>  <i>Bruised,</i>
or <i>crushed, date-stones,</i> [with which camels are
fed, and] which are first moistened with water.
(L in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حفد</span>.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُضْحٌ</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span>.]

